{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isRedirect"},{"type":"text","value":" function can be used to determine if an object is a redirect object."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"isredirect-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"isRedirect options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isRedirect"},{"type":"text","value":" function accepts a single argument, an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"input"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"input","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"input"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An object to check if it is a redirect object"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"isredirect-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"isRedirect returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":" if the object is a redirect object"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":" if the object is not a redirect object"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { isRedirect } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction somewhere(obj: unknown) {\n  if (isRedirect(obj)) {\n    // ...\n  }\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"isredirect-options","text":"isRedirect options","level":2},{"id":"input","text":"input","level":4},{"id":"isredirect-returns","text":"isRedirect returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `isRedirect` function can be used to determine if an object is a redirect object.\n\n## isRedirect options\n\nThe `isRedirect` function accepts a single argument, an `input`.\n\n#### `input`\n\n- Type: `unknown`\n- Required\n- An object to check if it is a redirect object\n\n## isRedirect returns\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- `true` if the object is a redirect object\n- `false` if the object is not a redirect object\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { isRedirect } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction somewhere(obj: unknown) {\n  if (isRedirect(obj)) {\n    // ...\n  }\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: isRedirectFunction\ntitle: isRedirect function\n---\n\nThe `isRedirect` function can be used to determine if an object is a redirect object.\n\n## isRedirect options\n\nThe `isRedirect` function accepts a single argument, an `input`.\n\n#### `input`\n\n- Type: `unknown`\n- Required\n- An object to check if it is a redirect object\n\n## isRedirect returns\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- `true` if the object is a redirect object\n- `false` if the object is not a redirect object\n\n## Examples\n\n```tsx\nimport { isRedirect } from '@tanstack/react-router'\n\nfunction somewhere(obj: unknown) {\n  if (isRedirect(obj)) {\n    // ...\n  }\n}\n```\n"}
